{"id":"qzm42w7q5amwrwgh0tgo5al9q","title":"为关心发声辩护","originalTitle":"In Defense of Giving a Shit","summary":"作者在独立游戏节（IGF）评审中发现，关于游戏使用AI的争议十分激烈，特别是Big Walk案例引发了大量讨论。作者认为IGF需要制定AI内容政策，并讨论了是否应禁止AI内容的问题。虽然有人认为AI代码已成为常态不应被禁止，但作者强调制定规则的重要性在于传达社区价值观并提供明确的执行依据。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://www.possibilityspace.org/blog/posts/in-defence-of-giving-a-shit/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T12:00:45.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T15:11:55.327Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T15:11:55.327Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["教程与观点","GitHub"],"score":47,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"a0bc52b6-5718-4046-88d8-423fb630261a","title":"IGF评审激辩AI游戏内容政策"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"a0bc52b6-5718-4046-88d8-423fb630261a","title":"IGF评审激辩AI游戏内容政策"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fgka1GrMGWbc","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}